  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "47",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 47"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "47",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yosefu acha mwa Farao mala amuboolela ali, “Paapa wase ne bawandaayase, ne kiminyele kiabwe, ne kamatuuli kabwe, ne bibiindu biabwe bioosi, bechile khukhwama mu sibala sia Kanaani, siise sino bali e Kosieni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khukhwama mu bawandaaye, abukulamo basaani baraano, mala abekesia khu Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao areeba bawandaaye ali, “Kimilimo kienywe kili siina?” Bakobosia bali, “Bakholi bowo bali babaayi be bibiaayo nga bapaapa befwe ne baaba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Khwichile khumenyekho mu sibala sino, sikila bakholi bowo se bali ne kamaayilwe ke bibiaayo tawe, lundi enjala eli endafu lukali mu sibala sia Kanaani. Nono khukhusaba okhue efwe bakholi bowo kumunwa khumenye mu sibala sia Kosieni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio, Farao aboolela Yosefu ali, “Paapa wowo ne bawandaayo bechile khwiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibala sia Misiri sili ebweeni wowo, elesia paapa wowo ne bawandaayo kamaloba kamalayi khukhila koosi mu sibala sino bamenyemo. Lekha bamenye mu maloba ka Kosieni. Ne waaba ne omanyile mu nibo, basaani banyala khukhunjayila chikhaafu chase bareekho banjayile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu areera Yakobo, raraawe, amwekesia khu Farao mala Yakobo abiita Farao chikhabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Farao areeba Yakobo ali, “Ewe oli ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko kinga?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akobosia Farao ali, “Bulamu bwase bwe khuuya-uuya buli kimiiko emia ndala ne kamakhumi kataru. Kimiiko ekio kili mikeekhe mala kie butinyu ne se kilekhaana ne kimiiko kimikali kie bulamu bwe khuuya-uuya bwe bakuuka base tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yakobo abiita Farao chikhabi mala arura ebweeni wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu amenyia raraawe ne bawandaaye, abaa kumukabwa mu sibala sia Misiri, mu maloba kamalayi khukhila koosi, mu lukoongo lwe Ramusesi nga Farao ne aaba ne alaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yosefu aelesia raraawe, bawandaaye ne babaandu boosi be munju mwa raraawe siakhulia, khuloondekhana ne babaandu nibo baba ne nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enjala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Siakhulia se siabakhoo mu sibala tawe. Enjala yaba endafu lukali, mala babaandu be mu Misiri ne mu Kanaani bang'aa lukali sikila enjala eyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu abuusia chirupia mu sibala sia Misiri ne sia Kanaani nga kumuruungo kwe biakhulia nibio babaandu bakula mala achiyila mwichipi lia Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga chirupia choosi chaba ne chiweele mu sibala sia Misiri ne mu sibala sia Kanaani, Bamisiri boosi becha khu Yosefu mala baloma bali, “Khue biakhulia! Okhakhulekha khwafwila mumoni chowo tawe, sikila chirupia chefwe choosi chaweele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu abakobosia ali, “Chirupia chenywe chaba ne chiweele, mbe bibiaayo ne ese ndamuua enywe biakhulia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio bareera bibiaayo khu Yosefu, mala Yosefu abaa biakhulia khulwe khukulasia ne chifarasi, ne kiminyele, kamatuuli, ne chipunda chabwe. Kumwiiko okwo abaelesia biakhulia khulwe khukulasiamo bibiaayo biabwe bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga kumwiiko okwo ne kwawa, becha khu Yosefu mala bamuboolela bali, “Omwami se khulakhukisa tawe, chirupia chefwe choosi chaweele, ne bibiaayo biefwe bioosi, luno bili bibiowo. Se siliio siramire nisio khunyala khwakhua tawe, ne kakhali fwabene ne kamaloba kefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhakhulekha khwafwila mumoni chowo tawe. Khukule efwe ne kamaloba kefwe mala efwe ne kimikuunda kiefwe khulaba nasioobi ba Farao, khue biakhulia khulie enjala ekhakhwira tawe, lundi khue bumiicho khumiiche mu mikuunda kikhaba busa tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yosefu akulila Farao kimikuunda kie mu sibala sia Misiri kioosi, sikila Bamisiri boosi bakusia kimikuunda kiabwe khulwe enjala eyaba endafu lukali khu nibo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala akhola babaandu mu Misiri mwoosi baba nasioobi ba Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimikuunda kie basaayi kiong'ene nikio akhakula tawe, sikila basaayi baba ne sikelo sie biakhulia buli lwoosi khukhwama khu Farao, mala bamenyela khulwe khunyoola biakhulia nibio Farao abaechanga. Khwako se bakusia kimikuunda kiabwe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yosefu aboolela babaandu ali, “Lola endaalo yino namukulile enywe ne kimikuunda kienywe mube ba Farao. Nono bumiicho obusiina mumiichemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khukhwola mu likesa, mulielesia Farao silala khu biraano sie likesa lienywe ne biramire bibe biakhulia bienywe ne bumiicho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamukobosia bali, “Wakhuoniisie: Omwami nosiima efwe khulaba nasioobi ba Farao.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yosefu alikhola liaba lilaka mu sibala sia Misiri, ali silala khu biraano sie likesa sili sia Farao. Lilaka lino lisiliio khukhwola luno. Kamaloba ke basaayi kong'ene kakhaba ka Farao tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lilienya lia Yakobo limaliilisi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
