              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "50.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne nga siise siola sie lifwa lia Isiraeli, alaanga omwana wewe Yosefu amuboolela ali, “Naaba luno ne nyoolile kumwalaalo mumoni mwowo, ra kumukhono kwowo akari we kamaraango kase mala unjechubile oli se olisiikha mu sibala sia Misiri sino tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenya siikhwe niio bapaapa bali, sute undusie mu Misiri mala musiikhe niio nibo basiikhwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
